WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.337
What does she see beyond

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.039
my Zanku Hadoken?

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:09.876
What are you waiting for?

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:14.347
What kind of opening
are you waiting for, Ono?

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.717
How can she be so patient?

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.054
Finding a foolproof way to win
no matter the means.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.391
Isn't that how to win?

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.230
I'm just playing the way that gives me
a 100-percent chance of winning.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:32.565
But...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.702
what is this feeling?

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.705
Guilt?

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:45.445
I don't care if this kind of attack is
contrary to my love of fighting games.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:48.715
Hidaka.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.319
I don't want to lose to anyone
who doesn't want to lose.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:55.822
Damn!

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.160
Is it possible...

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.063
that the chance you were waiting for...

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.232
wasn't in the game, but with me?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.070
My guilty feelings caused me
to let my guard down.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.506
Crap! Akuma needs to
take control again, fast!

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.181
Final Atomic Buster!

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.921
She came from behind
to tie it up at one-all.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.757
While doggedly defending,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.794
she waited for my pride as a gamer
to cause me to falter...

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.765
due to my desire to win by fighting fair

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.301
and my desire to win
with superior technique.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.876
My desire to win a fight
fair and square...

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.445
That's what she was aiming for! But...

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.217
My Zanku Hadoken isn't working anymore!

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.855
I tremble even when he gets close!

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.826
A Screw Piledriver while walking?
How is that possible?

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.631
You have to spin the lever around,
so you usually jump.

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:19.005
She spins it with a flick of her fingers?

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.307
She is...

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.310
truly astounding!

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.883
It only makes sense
that she would steal Yaguchi's heart.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:44.831
If Ono's strength at this is...

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.868
as strong as her love for Yaguchi...

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.605
then the level of my love is...

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.279
nothing compared to hers!

